{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38321","headline":"中秋陪熙用学士禁中翫月 · 吴融","name":"中秋陪熙用学士禁中翫月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月圆年十二，秋半每多阴。\n此夕无纤霭，同君宿禁林。\n未高知海阔，当午见宫深。\n衣似繁霜透，身疑积水沈。\n遭逢陪侍辇，归去忆抽簪。\n太液池南岸，相期到晓吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38321.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38321","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}